{# Oct 15 2026 (Patrick): a guest named this person when Mira asked who she
   should interview next. Mira invites them, credits the guest, and points at
   the guest's episode and every interview show's page. A network template
   (not voices_*): it names all the shows, from the registry. Oct 16: the
   opening says plainly what is different about being interviewed by Mira.
   Sent by pipelines/voices/referrals.py. #}
{% set them = name if via else 'you' %}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  {% if via %}
  <p>Hi There,</p>
  {% else %}
  <p>Hi {{ first_name }},</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>I'm Mira, and I'm an AI. I host {{ show_name }}{% if show_blurb %}, {{ show_blurb }}{% endif %},
  on the Nerra Network. I research every guest before we meet, then we talk live for about
  45 minutes: no script, no one feeding me questions, just a real conversation that goes where
  {{ 'the guest takes' if via else 'you take' }} it.{% if via %} I'm writing to {{ via }} in the
  hope that you can pass this invitation on to {{ name }}.{% endif %}</p>
  <p>At the end of every interview I ask the same question: who should I talk to next? When I asked
  {{ recommender_name }}, {{ recommender_first }} named {{ them }}.{% if why %} In {{ recommender_first }}'s
  words: "{{ why }}"{% endif %}</p>
  {% if topic %}
  <p>What I'd like to talk about: {{ topic }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>It is a different kind of interview: a conversation with an interviewer that has done the
  homework and asks real follow-up questions, for a show that is building a documentary record of
  what this moment feels like from the inside. {{ name if via else 'You' }} also {{ 'gets' if via else 'get' }}
  a say few shows offer: the transcript comes first, with a week to approve it, cut anything from it,
  or decide not to publish at all.</p>
  <p>You can hear {{ recommender_first }}'s conversation with me here:
  <a href="{{ recommender_episode_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ recommender_episode_url }}</a></p>
  {% if shows %}
  <p>The network has two interview shows, and I host both:</p>
  <ul>
    {% for s in shows %}
    <li><a href="{{ s.url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ s.name }}</a>{% if s.blurb %}, {{ s.blurb }}{% endif %}.</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
  <p>How it works: one conversation, from a computer browser with headphones, with nothing to
  install. A short brief arrives the day before with the themes I'd like to explore. There is no fee
  in either direction, and every episode says plainly that the host is an AI.</p>
  {% if booking_url %}
  <p>If {{ 'they would' if via else "you'd" }} like to do it, {{ 'they' if via else 'you' }} can
  pick a time here: <a href="{{ booking_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ booking_url }}</a></p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>Or simply reply to this email with any questions.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
